<phone-id> demo      android  Pixel 8  active  <session-id>
.EE

.PP
\fBStandard error\fP

.PP
None.

.PP
\fBExit status:\fP 0.

.PP
\fBNotes:\fP An empty successful result prints No dedicated phones.

.PP
\fBSample 2\fP

.PP
\fBInvocation\fP

.EX
